		<releaseNotes>In this release we made the following updates:
 
• Added a confirmation dialog for RDP file-based connections, showing the remote PC name and shared local resources.
• Prevented duplicate desktop sessions when the same connection is launched in quick succession.
• Improved stability when pinning, unpinning, and reordering apps and devices in the Connection Center.
• Fixed an issue that could cause the app to become unresponsive when deleting a workspace.
• Improved reliability when initiating multiple Microsoft Entra ID-authenticated connections concurrently.
• Made targeted security fixes for clipboard redirection, remote session watermarking, certificate parsing, and RDP licensing.
 
If you encounter any errors, you can contact us via Help &gt; Submit Feedback.</releaseNotes>
